        "languageCode": "sr"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "I had a wonderful experience at this dental clinic. The doctor was incredibly kind, caring, and compassionate. I highly recommend this clinic to anyone looking for excellent dental care. Thank you so much! ❤️",
